# ============================================================
# MARKET INTELLIGENCE V3 — LIQUIDITY DAILY PRO FINAL
# ============================================================
# Conservative append-only override for the V2 Markets module.
# - Keeps Fixed Income and all routing contracts unchanged.
# - Replaces only Liquidity Daily.
# - Eliminates sequential 25-second FRED timeouts.
# - Uses FRED API first (when FRED_API_KEY is configured), then
#   short-timeout public CSV fallback, concurrent requests, disk cache,
#   stale-cache fallback and a provider circuit breaker.
# - Uses a single lazy subview instead of st.tabs, so only the active
#   Liquidity subsection is executed.
# - Registers 124 analytical views: 33 Liquidity, 24 Leverage,
#   37 Bitcoin/Crypto and 30 Gold/Precious Metals.
# ============================================================

